      "date": "2026-05-19T11:45:04.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹11.45 (vs ₹8.95 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.45 (up from ₹8.95 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹8.62b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹957.5m (up 28% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 11% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 12% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
